.TH git-mora-topic-exec 1  "exec " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-topic\-exec \- Run a command with command\-scoped topic context
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora topic exec\fR [\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-topics\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIcommand\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a command with command\-scoped topic context
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<id>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-topics\fR
Explicitly empty context
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIcommand\fR>

